# Every text file is checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says: on a Windows clone the
# tests read the README, plugin.json and package.json as they are, and CRLF made them disagree
# (« plugin.json, package.json and the README agree » failed until npm run build rewrote them).
* text=auto eol=lf

# sounds and other binaries: never touched
*.wav binary
*.aif binary
*.aiff binary
*.flac binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.mod binary
*.med binary
*.png binary
